cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PI-GINOT, please cite the software and record the version or commit used."
title: "PI-GINOT"
type: software
version: 0.2.0.dev0
authors:
  - family-names: "Bahtiri"
    given-names: "Betim"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BBahtiri/verified-neural-operators"
abstract: >-
  Physics-informed neural operators for 2D finite-strain plane-stress
  elasticity, with fixed-profile STEP/DXF import, per-geometry training,
  FEM comparison and reusable model bundles. Prediction claim levels
  remain bounded by the recorded verification evidence.
keywords:
  - neural operator
  - physics-informed machine learning
  - finite-strain elasticity
  - verification
